<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Thes</para>
  <para style="toc1">eljwab eglewwel ala tseluwniyki</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Ths</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TH</para>
  <para style="mt1">eljwab eglewwel ala tseluwniyki</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">ettehiyyeθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />seg buwlus d siyla d tiymuwtawus y eljmaεeθ n imumnen g elkeniyseθ n tseluwniyki, elli θebεen erreb deddaθne d seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. eslam d enneεmeθ fellawem. <verse eid="1TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />nečin diyme ncexxer g erreb f elxeĎrewwem elkul, w ndeεεuyawem g ezzelliθenne. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />max enebδe ezzaθ n daddeθne ensfekker elεmayluwwem tibehhayin elli θegimtent εlexaTer γerwem eliman, γerwem exse, w γerwem ettaf eSHiyH g erjewwem n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />nečin nessen ey ewmaθen elli yexsin erreb, elli erreb yexθerawem y imenes. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />εlexaTer max i xenbeccer s ellinjiyl eltkenc elxeδmtenne s edwi berk, emme s elquwweθ zade, d erruwH elqudus, w s θiqeθ δ temeqqarθ. w xenyum tessenem elli max i nkan γerwem neSSerref s elli δiys elxiyr y xenyum. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />w xenyum teθbeεmane nečin d elmesiyH. w reγm elli tufim elqleq δ emeqqar teqbelem edwi n erreb s elferH n erruwH elqudus. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />eyendeγ teδwelem elmθel y imumnen elkul elli g meqdunye d exeYiye. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />terniym tencerem edwi n erreb muc g meqdunye d axaye berk, emme elxber n elimenewwem s erreb yiweD y elblayes elkul. w elyeqqimc edwi eθnen y leεbaδ g elHkeyeθe. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />w nihnin Hekkan max i θefrHem essiyne elweqtelli nuseδ tweliwwem, terjεem y erreb, tebεδem f leSnam bac e θeεbδem erreb elHeq elli yedder, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />etrajem g memmis elli δedyes seg esmaweθ, w nette elli ysikkirθi erreb seg jar inemmitte, nette yesuwε elli exeninejje seg elγuc n erreb elli δedyas.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">elxeδmeθ n buwlus g tseluwniyki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />xenyum eyemmaθen tessenem elli eseδenne tweliwwem likenc δ elbaTel. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />w θessenem, qebl n elli exendnas, exenεemlenc belgde g filibbi, w reγm elli nufe elmuεerDeθ δ temeqqerθ, errebbenne yuceyane elquwweθ δ temeqqerθ bac e nbeccer s ellinjiyl. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />w nečin enneSSeHc s tixerxas ziγ s elHiyleθ ziγ s exδaε. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />belεeks erreb yufeyane qadriyn yesθemnane f ellinjiyl. w nečin netbeccer muc bac e nreDDe leεbaδ emme bac e nreDDe erreb elli yetjerreb g ulewnenne. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />w edwinne muc δ imretteb emmax i θesnem, w muc δ eTmeε w erreb exenyecheδ s wah. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />w enHewwemc f elmdiyH n leεbaδ y nečin, la seg xenyum w la seg elγirewwem. emmale wah δ elHeqqenne max e neĎleb essiywem egget, εlexaTerne δ imersal n elmesiyH. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />emme max i nkan iδwem nkan netεamel diywem emmax i tεawen temeTTuθ elli tessesfe g idreris. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />nečin nexsawem elineδwel nexs exennuwc muc kan δ ellinjiyl n rebbi berk emme Hette δ lerweHenne zade, εlexaTer teδwelem etεezzem fellane egget.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />w xenyum ettesfekkarem ey ewmaθen max i nexδem netεeb, εlexaTer nkan netbelγawem g elbcareθ n erreb, nkan nxeddem g deggiδ d dugges bac enDellebc seg Hed essiywem. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />xenyum eθechδem w erreb eyecheδ max i nkan netteSSerraf jar imumnen, s eTTehareθ d etteqwe w blac elεiyb. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />w xenyum tessenem elli nεemlawem emmax yetεawen eryaz g idreris. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />nkan nečejjeε w netεezze δiywem w nĎelleb essiywem, eθedrem emmax i yexs erreb elli yetnebeyawem bac eθeδfem elmemlexθes čerxem g eljlales.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />w zaδe enecxer erreb diyme εlexaTer max i θesliym edwi elli nbecrawem essis teqblemti muc m edwi nleεbaδ emme emmax nette belHeq δ edwi n erreb elli yxeddem δiywem xenyum imumnen. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />teδwlem ya ewmeθniyw m eljmaεeθ n imumnen g temuwreθ n yehuwde, meεnahe ecceεb n elmesiyH yesuwε elli δiyn, elyehuwd εeδbenten, emmax xenyum zade temurθewwem tεeδbawem. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />elyehuwd nihnin elli nγiyn seyyedne yesuwε d lembiye, w ture δexenεeδben nečin zade. w nihnin esserdenc erreb w etεaδan leεbaδ elkul. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />w exennedjinc enbecer y elli muc δ uδayen bac elmenεenc. w renniyn g eδnubensen eyendeγ εlac e yeggez fellasen elγuc n erreb y ellexxer.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />emme nečin ya ewmaθen, max i nebεeδ fellawem elmuddeθ δ tiqSeyyerθ, s uwδem berk w muc s uwl, nerni necθeqawem exθer w nexs anezr uδmewwem. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />heδake εlac nexs ednes tweliwwem bexSuSi neč buwlus, Hewle exθer n elmerreθ, emme ecciyĎan exenyedjiyc.<verse eid="1TH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />δwiyn δ eykuwn elferHenne d ettaj n erjenne as elli edyes seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH? beTbiyεe δ xenyum. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />belHeq xenyum elmejδenne d elferHenne.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />w max engeddec eneθHemmel exθer, nqerrer enraje weHδane g eθiyne. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />nazen Timuθawes yewweθne w elli yxeddem iδne g elxeδmeθ n erreb y encar n elmesiyH. nuzenti bac e xenyθebbet yqewweyawem g eliman, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />bac e liredjeε Hed s eεaniye. xenyum biδkum tessenem elli wah δ elmexθubenne. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />max i nkan γerwem nxebrawem elli δenεane s elεδab. ySar wah belHeq emmax i θesnem. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />heδake εlac uzenγawem max elgeddexc eθHemle bac e sne elHal n elimenewwem, bac e lyetkunc ibliys yeγweyawem iDaε etteεbenne.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />w ture yerjeε timutawes seg γerwem, yeγδane lexbar ibehhayen f elimenewwem d elmHebθewwem. w yxebrane elli xenyum diyme tferHem max exentesfekrem, w texsem exentezrem emmax i nexs nečin exennezr. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />heδakeεlac ey ewmaθen, yeδwel elimenewwem yečejjeε δiyne g elHeznenne d elwjeyεenne elkul. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />yeHlewane eddar meδemkum θebtiyn g elmesiyH. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />nečin nferreH essiywem egget ezzaθ n errebbenne, w max enged enecxer erreb f elferHe elli yuceyenexθi essiywem? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />nečin nĎelleb δiys deggiδ d dugges bac e xennezr usinc enkemmel essen elli δ ennaqez g elimenewwem.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />eneĎleb seg errebbenne d deddaθne d seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH eymiyr ebriδ ezzeθenne bac e neHDer tweliwwem. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />w eneĎleb seg elmesiyH ayedj elmHebθewwem y beεDkum d leεbaδ elkul e θerni teqwe m elmHebθenne y xenyum. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />usinc e yθebbet ulewnewwem bac e θkuwnem δ eTTuhhar ezzaθ n rebbi deddeθne max edyas seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH d iqeddisnes elkul.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />w g ellexxer ey ewmaθen, eneĎleb essiywem neθrejjeyawem s ellesm n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH bac e θedrem s elli eyreDDe erreb, emmax i θeθεelmem essiyne w emmax i ttegem, erniθ eθqedmeθ g wah. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />xenyum tessenem enSayeH elli nuceyewemten s ellemr n seyyedne yesuwε. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />erreb yexs eθkuwnem y nette, heδakeεlac yelzem eθebεδem f ezne. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />w kul iyjen essiywem ayedj elbeδnes δ eTTaher w δ ucriyf, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />w eliθebbeεc eccehweθ m iberreniyyin elli ellessinenc erreb. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />w elyetteθεeddi Hed essiywem f yewwas ziγ esyeg temuwHacθ g ellemre wah. w emmax nečin nεerfawem seg qebl n nebhawem eSbiyH, rebbi eyentqem s kul Hed ayeg eccer. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />εlexaTer erreb yexθerane enkuwn muc δ imenzas emme enedder δ eTTuhhar. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />emmale elli eyerfeD etteεliyme, elyerfiDc leεbaδ, emme yerfeD erreb elli yθučawem erruHes elqudus.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />w xenyum etteHθejemc exennerye f elmHebθewwem y imumnen, εlexaTer erreb yεelmawem eθexsem beεDkum. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />w sah xenyum texsem ewmaθen elli g meqduniye elkul. w nečin nexs eθegem wah exθer, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />usinc eθeHrSem f eddar elεiyceθ δ terrayet, w etteddexlemc g lumuwr n elγirewwem, usinc eθexsbem erziwwem s elεerq n eljbinewwem emmax i xenεellem. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />siyn exenneHθermen elli muc δ imumnen, w eθεemlem f Hed bac e yeSref fellawem.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />w nexsawem eθesnem elli ySar y elli emmuwθen, bac e ltHeznemc m elli elγersenc eθmenni. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />emmax nečin ntemmen elli yesuwε yemmuwθ yekker seg temettent, w entemmen zaδe δ entisikker erreb bac e ddasen iyδes elli emmuwθen w nihnin temnen essis. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />nečin exenxebber s edwi elli yenni elmesiyH biyδe, nečin elli nedder max edyes, ensebbeqc elli emmuwθen. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />εlexaTer ekren g ellewwel imumnen elli emmenen essis emmuwθen, elweqθes enabi eyeqwe w errayes n elmlayxe eynabe, w elbuwq eyexδem, w elmesiyH biyδe edyes seg esme. usinc <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />w elbeεεeδ enemmexĎef iδsen g esHab nečin elli nedder bac e nqabel elmesiyH g elhwe, w siyn enkuwn iyδes diyme. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />emmale cejεeθ beεDkum s edwiye.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />ey ewmaθen, xenyum ettesθHeqqemc exennerye ettarix d elmwaεiδ n ellumuwre. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />w xenyum tessenem belgde elli as n erreb edyes emmax i θaseδ essareq g δeggiyδ. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />w max ennen leεbaδ kul ciy g leman w lebas ehelxen εle γefle, emmax elwjayeε eθγafel temeTTuθ elli δ θaru, w etgeddenc eruwlen. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />emme xenyum ey ewmaθen, mekumc g tsellesθ. emmale asdiyn exenyetγefilc m essareq. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />xenyum elkul iθbab n tefuwθ d iθbab n dugges, nečin menac δ iθbab n δeggiyδ d tsellesθ. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />heδake εlac yelzem enneεεesc emmax i θegen iddiyn, emme enesher neTTef imenenne. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />εlexaTer g δeggiyδ eneεsen elli neεsen, w g δeggiyδ zade esxren elli sexren. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />emme nečin iθbab n dugges w yelzem eneTTef imenenne, usinc eniyreD eliman d exse m edderε bac e neHme eSSeδrenne, w eθmenni m elkeskeθ bac e nmenneε ixfenne. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />εlexaTer erreb yexθerane muc bac e nqaSe elγucces, emme bac e nemneε s seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />w elmesiyH yemmuwθ f elxeDrenne bac e nedder iyδes, siwe nkan nedder welle nemmuwθ g elweqθ n eseδes. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />emmale cejεeθ beεDkum, tqewwam beεDkum emmax i ttegem ture,<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />w eneĎleb essiywem ey ewmaθen, eθeHθermem elli xedmen egget jerawem, w elli nihnin δ elquyyeδ w δ imuεelmen y xenyum g leHyeθewwem g elmesiyH. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />eHθermemten egget texsemten f elxaĎer n elxeδmeθ elli tegen δiys. edreθ jmiyε g eslam. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />w eneĎleb essiywem ey ewmaθen: nebheθ f ibuxliyyen, cejεeθ imeθqelqen, εewneθ idεiyfen, eSbreθ elkul f beεDkum. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />eθegemc eccer y eccer, emme diyme egeθ elxiyr y beεĎkum d leεbaδ elkul. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />efrHeθ diyme, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />ezzelleθ diyme, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />eHmdeθ erreb f kul ciy, εlexaTer wah elli yexsi essiywem erreb m imumnen s elmesiyH yesuwε. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />eθsensemc elεefyeθ n erruwH, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />eθeHqremc ennubuwweθ. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />belεeks jerbeθ kul ciy teTfem g elli xiyr, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />tebεδem f eccer s lenweεes elkul.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />w eĎelbe seg erreb neslam exenyedje y nette g kul ciy, usinc exenyeHfeD bkulkum belgde, erruH d ennefs d elbδen blac elεiyb al asaδ n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />elli ynebeyawem θiyqeθ bac ayeg elweεδes.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />ey ewmaθen ezzelleθ f elxeĎrenne. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />selmeθ f ewmaθen elkul s uwl δ eTTaher.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />exeweSSiyγ ezzaθ n elmesiyH, eθeqram eljwabe y ewmaθen elkul. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />eθmenniyγ enneεmeθ n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH eθkun iδwem.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>